<Layout title="About — Zeqing Wang" description="About Zeqing Wang's research interests and approach to research engineering.">
  <article class="about-shell">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I am Zeqing Wang, a researcher and engineer working across computer vision, 3D reconstruction, machine learning, and robotics.</p>
    <p>My preferred way of working sits between research and implementation: formulate a precise question, build the smallest system that can test it, and make the result understandable and reproducible.</p>

    <h2>Research interests</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Motion understanding and correspondence</li>
      <li>3D geometry, reconstruction, and visualization</li>
      <li>Learning-based perception and intelligent systems</li>
      <li>Research software and reproducible workflows</li>
    </ul>

    <p>A fuller academic record, including education, publications, and a downloadable CV, will be added when the material is ready for public release.</p>
    <a class="back-link" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>← Back to homepage</a>
